+// OnPreSetup: the port's defaults for SDK settings (GPU settings, anti-aliasing, occlusion queries).
+void ApplyDefaults();
+
+// OnPostInitLogging: version, commit, CPU clock; the GPU driver's options (gow2_radv_debug, gow2_gpu_trace), set
+// before the SDK starts the GPU.
